@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-41 - View Low Stock Alert

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Inventory UI" as FE
control "InventoryController" as API
control "InventoryService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoesDetail, stockMovements" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-41
FE -> API: GET /inventory/overview
API -> Service: Execute View Low Stock Alert
Service -> DB: Read/write shoesDetail, stockMovements
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Danh sách sản phẩm low stock hiển thị

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang xem inventory
Post: Danh sách sản phẩm low stock hiển thị
Main flow:
1. System tự động highlight sản phẩm có stock <= 5 (vàng) hoặc = 0 (đỏ)
2. Admin vào tab Low Stock
3. System gọi API GET /inventory/overview; frontend filters low stock
4. Hiển thị danh sách cần nhập hàng
end note
@enduml
